pay
├── given valid authorization and supported finality
│   ├── pulls gross payer amount atomically
│   ├── sends platform fee to treasury
│   ├── burns the remainder through CCTP
│   └── guarantees burn minus max CCTP fee is at least merchant settlement
├── given Base/Fast capability
│   └── accepts 1000 and 2000 finality
├── given Avalanche/no-Fast capability
│   ├── rejects 1000
│   └── accepts 2000
├── given wrong destination, payer, signature, fee or time window
│   └── reverts before moving funds
└── given replayed attempt or paid intent on this source chain
    └── reverts

administration
├── owner rotates signer, treasury and guardian
├── guardian can pause but never unpause
└── configured fee cap is immutable and bounded to 1 percent
